cmd-livingstationreport-desc = Reports your current station tile to the Living Station security officer.
cmd-livingstationreport-help = Run livingstationreport while standing at the location to investigate.
living-station-report-accepted = The security officer has been assigned to investigate your location.
living-station-report-unavailable = No officer is available to investigate this location.

cmd-livingstationwork-desc = Shows Living Station crew work, queues, blockers, routes and counters without changing assignments.
cmd-livingstationwork-help = Run livingstationwork with no arguments. Requires server administration permission.
